    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d670">

                <pb facs="0784" n="710" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg710"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2992</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Special Agent in Serbia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Dodge</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nice</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-10-17T10:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 17, 1918, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received October 18, 10.15
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your circular September 20, 6 p.m., regarding terrorism, in Russia communicated
                    to Acting Minister for Foreign Affairs who telegraphs to-day substantially as
                    follows: <pb facs="0785" n="711" xml:id="pg711"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Serbian Government shares the view of the Government of the United States
                            that measures should be taken to end Bolshevist terrorism, and after
                            examining the question of the non-military measures which it could take
                            has come to the conclusion that it has no means at its disposal except
                            to express its aversion to the acts of terrorism in Russia. Serbian
                            Government is also ready to associate itself with the Government of the
                            United States in any action of the same nature.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodge</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
